/*  EXPECTED: COMPILES and runs; compiled output must match the interpreter.

    A helper sets an item of the series it is given to a text it builds from its argument.

    A text is never refused; one stored where a body cannot see how long the target lives is
    copied, when the program runs, into the region the target itself lives in (docs/SOUNDNESS.md,
    obligation O4). */

Bind void to rename, given (the series of text bag, the text given-name):
    Item 1 of bag becomes given-name joined to "!".
Done.
Define names as a series of text with ("outer").
Pull a rabbit.
    Cast rename on (names, "in" joined to "ner").
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State names.
